  "bound_rationale": "Engineer-declared broad design bounds, not learned or safety limits. Natural vetiver and juniper vary widely without original-dose floors. Iso E is limited as support; coriander, cedar, cypress, terpinyl remain modifiers. Same 5400 raw uL stock subtotal. Six unsupported stocks fixed to localize this pass, not validated as optimal. Nominal raw-volume proxy only; exact mass ppm unknown. Stress multipliers 0.8/1.15 are engineering probes, not analytical ranges or confidence intervals.",
