  "design_envelopes": "Common search post-filter: cypress<=0.1*juniper, gin>=petitgrain+terpinyl, natural vetiver>=0.5*IsoE. root=vetiver+Vetikon+Vetival; wood=IsoE+cedar+Clearwood+Timberol; gin=juniper+coriander+grapefruit. Vetiver-bodied:root>=wood,gin>=0.5*root. Gin-forward:gin>=root,root+wood>=1.5*gin. Rounded:0.75*wood<=root<=1.25*wood,root+wood>=2*gin. All ratios are engineering hypotheses, not perceived intensity or learned sensory targets.",
