    "rationale": "Parent engineering selection: gin-forward developed-base front chosen over higher isolated-model pleasantness wood-heavy fronts because juniper remains near natural vetiver loading rather than falling toward 450-530 uL. Source random-arm Pareto candidate rounded to 10 uL grid, sum remains5400; this proposal is evaluated separately after rounding. Both juniper and natural vetiver increase versus v4; dry woody support replaces some Hedione/BB/Vetikon allocation. This is a brief-led hypothesis, not learned richness/layering, sensory validation or a mixing card. Re-evaluate this same rounded proposal after geraniol/nerol stereochemical separation; lineage receipt is the initial search, not final-model Pareto certification.",
